\ PART 0: BOOT VECTORS.

COLD \ call to cold start location: the engine starts executing here,
     \ with the image's base address on the data stack.
WARM \ call to warm start location.
LOCALS-CELLS \ five cells at image offset 8, for the engine's locals
     \ opcodes: shadow.4 fills them in when it loads (CV8-REFERENCE.md
